What is a Hydraulic Diamond Core Drill Rig?
A Hydraulic Diamond Core Drill Rig is a specialized drilling unit that combines the power of hydraulic actuation with diamond‑infused core barrels. The hydraulic system delivers consistent torque and pressure, while the diamond‑coated cutters shear through rock with minimal wear. These rigs are engineered to retrieve continuous, undisturbed core samples, enabling accurate geological modelling, mineral resource estimation, and geotechnical analysis. Typical applications include deep‑earth mineral exploration, geothermal energy boreholes, underground infrastructure development, and advanced engineering investigations.
